BEL@LOCALIZED_STRING_SS}\" data-pim-cta-note=\"${CUSTOMER_EXPERIENCE_LANDING_07_PRICING_PIM_PRICING_CTA_NOTE@LOCALIZED_STRING_SS}\"><div class=\"seo-sec__head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">${CUSTOMER_EXPERIENCE_LANDING_07_PRICING_PIM_PRICING_EYEBROW@LOCALIZED_STRING_SS}</span><h2 class=\"seo-sec__title\">${CUSTOMER_EXPERIENCE_LANDING_07_PRICING_PIM_PRICING_TITLE@LOCALIZED_STRING_SS}</h2></div><div class=\"seo-price\" data-pim-body><div class=\"seo-price__row\"><span class=\"seo-skel\" style=\"width:30%\"></span><span class=\"seo-skel\" style=\"width:18%\"></span></div><div class=\"seo-price__row\"><span class=\"seo-skel\" style=\"width:30%\"></span><span class=\"seo-skel\" style=\"width:18%\"></span></div><div class=\"seo-price__row\"><span class=\"seo-skel\" style=\"width:30%\"></span><span class=\"seo-skel\" style=\"width:18%\"></span></div></div><div class=\"seo-price__cta\"><button class=\"btn btn--primary seo-cta\" data-module=\"seo-cta\" data-visual-id=\"seo-pricing-cta\" data-action=\"auth.gotoSignin\" data-state=\"idle\" data-bind=\"cms.pricing.cta\" aria-live=\"polite\">${CUSTOMER_EXPERIENCE_LANDING_07_PRICING_PIM_PRICING_CTA_LABEL@LOCALIZED_STRING_SS}</button></div></section>",
  "css": "/* ---------- 6 · pricing ---------- */\n.seo-price { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; max-width: 640px; }\n.seo-price__row {\n  display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 20px;\n  background: rgba(var(--glass),.5); border: 1px solid rgba(var(--hair),.07);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 13px 18px;\n}\n.seo-price__name { font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; }\n.seo-price__val b { font-size: 15px; }\n.seo-price__unit { color: var(--ink-3); font-size: 12px; }\n.seo-price__val--quote { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ink-2); font-style: italic; text-align: right; }\n.seo-price__cta { margin-top: 16px; }\n\n/* wave 12 · pim.pricing[] rows — optional shortDescription line */\n.seo-price__desc { display: block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; color: var(--ink-3); margin-top: 2px; }\n.seo-price__val { white-space: nowrap; } /* wave 12 — keep \"displayPrice / interval\" on one line */",
